  "description": "Brilliant, blunt, and determined to keep everyone at a distance, Irene Rios is a medical prodigy with an intense fear of being touched. Diego Cassis, the charming Grand Duke of Divoa, has long since grown bored with the world around him. But when he meets Irene, a woman utterly unimpressed by his title or charms, his interest is finally piqued. He needs her skills. She wants him to leave her alone. But as fascination draws these opposites closer, they may find themselves changing each other in ways neither expected. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
